  {
    "_key": "cf6de7c7afb1",
    "_type": "faqBlock",
    "faq": {
      "_type": "accordionBlock",
      "items": [
        {
          "_key": "a04c7e7cba8e",
          "answer": [
            {
              "_key": "02590207e5de",
              "_type": "block",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_key": "43d6a1b6131f",
                  "_type": "span",
                  "marks": [],
                  "text": "Pricing varies based on the project’s complexity, the number of pages, whether it’s multilingual, and the level of technical features required. A basic template-based website is significantly cheaper but often limits growth and SEO potential. A strategically developed business website in Cyprus is an investment designed to generate leads and long-term visibility. Pricing is determined after analyzing your goals, industry and growth objectives."
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": [],
              "style": "normal"
            }
          ],
          "question": "What does web design and development cost in Cyprus?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "c245744c30be",
          "answer": [
            {
              "_key": "d432f3edae39",
              "_type": "block",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_key": "9889598d1004",
                  "_type": "span",
                  "marks": [],
                  "text": "Professional web development includes strategy planning, UX structure, technical implementation, SEO-ready architecture, performance optimization, and content structure guidance. It is not only about visual design but about building a system that supports marketing, search visibility and conversions."
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": [],
              "style": "normal"
            }
          ],
          "question": "What’s typically covered in a professional website development package?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "c5bbb43fc564",
          "answer": [
            {
              "_key": "58e490a83cbd",
              "_type": "block",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_key": "4ddfe5da8234",
                  "_type": "span",
                  "marks": [],
                  "text": "Many Cyprus-based companies serve international clients. If your target audience includes foreign investors, tourists, or international partners, a multilingual website significantly increases trust and conversion rates. The structure must be properly implemented to support SEO in each language."
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": [],
              "style": "normal"
            }
          ],
          "question": "Do I need a multilingual website for my Cyprus business?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "8f715c76b47b",
          "answer": [
            {
              "_key": "817128d680fd",
              "_type": "block",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_key": "d106868903b5",
                  "_type": "span",
                  "marks": [],
                  "text": "Web design focuses primarily on visual appearance and layout. Website development includes technical architecture, functionality, scalability, SEO readiness and performance optimization. A successful business website requires both — integrated into one strategy."
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": [],
              "style": "normal"
            }
          ],
          "question": "What distinguishes web design from website development?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "e3ebceddfbb0",
          "answer": [
            {
              "_key": "b98d61516d99",
              "_type": "block",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_key": "21dabc94d75a",
                  "_type": "span",
                  "marks": [],
                  "text": "Yes, if built correctly. A properly structured website can rank for commercial search queries, generate inbound inquiries, and position your company as a credible authority. This becomes particularly crucial in highly competitive sectors such as real estate, legal services, and hospitality."
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": [],
              "style": "normal"
            }
          ],
          "question": "Can a website help my business in Limassol or Paphos attract more clients?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "41e8f38ce055",
          "answer": [
            {
              "_key": "697a874aca95",
              "_type": "block",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_key": "c90e37713e6c",
                  "_type": "span",
                  "marks": [],
                  "text": "In most cases, the process lasts between 4 and 8 weeks, depending on the project’s scope and complexity. Multilingual or advanced functionality projects may require additional planning and technical implementation time."
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": [],
              "style": "normal"
            }
          ],
          "question": "How long does website development take?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "6f601dd07d00",
          "answer": [
            {
              "_key": "ef0153d3d7e1",
              "_type": "block",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_key": "cb688005df4b",
                  "_type": "span",
                  "marks": [],
                  "text": "Yes. SEO principles are integrated during development, including structure, speed, schema markup and internal linking. This ensures your website is ready for long-term organic growth."
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": [],
              "style": "normal"
            }
          ],
          "question": "Do you provide SEO-ready websites?"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
